The hot canteen part 0 is some text that varies. The hot canteen part 0 is "Look at that sign! What does it say? It says Welcome to the hot canteen? Well that's cool.



There is an unblocked exit to the south.".
The description of r_99 is "[hot canteen part 0]".

The r_28 is mapped south of r_99.

The o_0 are object-likes.
The o_0 are privately-named.
